  "description": "A scoped, single-shot precision dart rifle inspired by Awakening. A dart that wounds a flesh target inflicts mild poison for ten seconds: eight percent additional pain and five percent lower moving capacity. The poison does not stack or refresh. Holtzman fields stop the fast dart. Its heavy dart puts greater strain on a blocking field than a light dart.",
